flowchart TD
    A([Device connects, no 802.1X supplicant]) --> B["Switch/AP sends MAB request<br/>(MAC as username)"]
    B --> C{"MAC registered?"}
    C -- No --> D[No network access]
    C -- Yes --> E["VLAN/role assigned to that MAC"]
    D -. Admin manually registers the MAC .-> C

    classDef reject fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7a1f1f
    classDef trusted fill:#dff5e3,stroke:#2e8b57,color:#1d5c39
    class D reject
    class E trusted
